    "detailed_description": "Take part in the grand adventure you've been training your whole life for. Set out from your home with nothing more than a sword and a map, find the lost Naxa Crystals and defeat the evil lurking behind every corner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind companions to join you in your quest. Help all those you find, or ignore them. Choose to spare or slay those who oppose you in your quest. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraverse settlements all over the world, finding strange and mysterious races and peoples. Most importantly, temper your resolve to become strong enough to save the world!",
    "about_the_game": "Take part in the grand adventure you've been training your whole life for. Set out from your home with nothing more than a sword and a map, find the lost Naxa Crystals and defeat the evil lurking behind every corner.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind companions to join you in your quest. Help all those you find, or ignore them. Choose to spare or slay those who oppose you in your quest. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTraverse settlements all over the world, finding strange and mysterious races and peoples. Most importantly, temper your resolve to become strong enough to save the world!",
